msgid "The transform stages a `plugins:` array actually drives are `tokens`, `icons`, and `css`; `rehype`\n(a render-time icon resolver) and `native` (Style Dictionary) are recorded as capabilities but are\ndownstream consumers, not guarded here."
msgstr "The transform stages a `plugins:` array actually drives are `tokens`, `icons`, and `css`; `rehype`\n(a render-time icon resolver) and `native` (Style Dictionary) are recorded as capabilities but are\ndownstream consumers, not guarded here."

