#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# props-minify"
msgstr "# props-minify"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"

