msgstr "`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nPass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override individual defaults — including\n`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."

