msgid "The base (unprefixed) element names this package registers. [register](../functions/register.md) mints a tag per name\nunder its `prefix` option — `icon` → `<instui-icon>` by default, or `<x-icon>` for `{ prefix: \"x\" }`.\nA prefix is always applied (a custom-element name must contain a hyphen), so an empty or nullish prefix\nfalls back to the default `instui`."
msgstr "The base (unprefixed) element names this package registers. [register](../functions/register.md) mints a tag per name\nunder its `prefix` option — `icon` → `&lt;instui-icon&gt;` by default, or `&lt;x-icon&gt;` for `{ prefix: \"x\" }`.\nA prefix is always applied (a custom-element name must contain a hyphen), so an empty or nullish prefix\nfalls back to the default `instui`."

