#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-icon>` — an inline SVG glyph from the pantoken icon set. The `name` attribute picks the\nglyph, `size` (any CSS length, default `1em`) sizes it, `color` (any CSS color) tints it, and\n`margin` adds spacing around it (InstUI keywords like `small`). Renders the SVG into its own light\nDOM, sized/coloured via inline styles on the host, so it inherits `currentColor` like text."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-icon&gt;` — an inline SVG glyph from the pantoken icon set. The `name` attribute picks the\nglyph, `size` (any CSS length, default `1em`) sizes it, `color` (any CSS color) tints it, and\n`margin` adds spacing around it (InstUI keywords like `small`). Renders the SVG into its own light\nDOM, sized/coloured via inline styles on the host, so it inherits `currentColor` like text."

